  "details": "In a previous version of VRChat, the VR camera menu function worked when flying in a plane. \n\nHowever, in the most recent version the VR camera menu function is bugged, because it cannot be selected when flying.\n\nFor example, if a person enters a plane, starts flying and then attempts to change the camera pin, zoom or turn on 'flight mode', the selection cannot be made as the menu flickers.\n\nPlease could you bring back this previous camera version, because it was so helpful for promoting VRChat content via making movies and taking pictures!",
